      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{由二项展开式} (1+x)^{a}=1+ax+\\frac{\\alpha(\\alpha-1)}{2!}x^{2}+\\cdots (-1&lt;x&lt;1), \\ \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; \\sqrt[3]{240}=\\sqrt[3]{3^{2}-3}=3(1-\\frac{1}{3^{2}})^{\\frac{1}{3}} , \\ \\text{取} \\ \\alpha=\\frac{1}{3}, \\ x=-\\frac{1}{3^{3}} , \\text{可得} \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; \\sqrt[3]{240}=3(1-\\frac{1}{3^{3}})^{\\frac{1}{3}}=3\\bigg[1+\\frac{1}{5}(-\\frac{1}{3^{3}})^{\\frac{1}{3}}+\\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{5}-1)\\cdot \\frac{1}{2!}(-\\frac{1}{3^{3}})^{2}+\\cdots \\bigg] \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; =3\\bigg(1-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3^{3}}-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2!}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3^{3}}-\\cdots \\bigg) \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; \\text{取前两项的和作为}\\sqrt[3]{240} \\text{的近似值}，\\text{其误差为} \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; |r_{2}|\\leq \\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2!}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3^{3}}=\\frac{2}{5^{2}\\cdot 3^{3}}&lt;0.0001, \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; \\text{故近似值为}\\sqrt[3]{240}\\approx 3\\bigg(1-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3^{3}}\\bigg)\\approx 2.9926 \\ \\phi \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{由二项展开式} (1+x)^{a}=1+ax+\\frac{\\alpha(\\alpha-1)}{2!}x^{2}+\\cdots (-1&lt;x&lt;1), \\ \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; \\sqrt[3]{240}=\\sqrt[3]{3^{2}-3}=3(1-\\frac{1}{3^{2}})^{\\frac{1}{3}} , \\ \\text{取} \\ \\alpha=\\frac{1}{3}, \\ x=-\\frac{1}{3^{3}} , \\text{可得} \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; \\sqrt[3]{240}=3(1-\\frac{1}{3^{3}})^{\\frac{1}{3}}=3\\bigg[1+\\frac{1}{5}(-\\frac{1}{3^{3}})^{\\frac{1}{3}}+\\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{5}-1)\\cdot \\frac{1}{2!}(-\\frac{1}{3^{3}})^{2}+\\cdots \\bigg] \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; =3\\bigg(1-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3^{3}}-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2!}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3^{3}}-\\cdots \\bigg) \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; \\text{取前两项的和作为}\\sqrt[3]{240} \\text{的近似值}，\\text{其误差为} \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; |r_{2}|\\leq \\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2!}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3^{3}}=\\frac{2}{5^{2}\\cdot 3^{3}}&lt;0.0001, \\ \\phi \\\\ &amp; \\text{故近似值为}\\sqrt[3]{240}\\approx 3\\bigg(1-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3^{3}}\\bigg)\\approx 2.9926 \\ \\phi \\end{aligned}</div>"
