      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{解：}\\quad e^{-x^{2}}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\left(-1\\right)^{n}\\frac{1}{n!}x^{2^{n}}\\\\&amp;\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}e^{-x^{2}}dx=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}[\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n}\\frac{1}{n!}x^{2^{n}}]dx=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}(1-\\frac{1}{2^{2}.3}+\\frac{1}{2^{4}.5.2!}-………)\\quad\\\\&amp;\\\\&amp;\\text{再考虑误差范围可求得}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}e^{-x^{2}}dx\\approx 0.5205\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{解：}\\quad e^{-x^{2}}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\left(-1\\right)^{n}\\frac{1}{n!}x^{2^{n}}\\\\&amp;\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}e^{-x^{2}}dx=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}[\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n}\\frac{1}{n!}x^{2^{n}}]dx=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}(1-\\frac{1}{2^{2}.3}+\\frac{1}{2^{4}.5.2!}-………)\\quad\\\\&amp;\\\\&amp;\\text{再考虑误差范围可求得}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}e^{-x^{2}}dx\\approx 0.5205\\end{aligned}</div>"
